= Hjalmar Schacht

One of the founders of the Deutsche Demokratische Partei, Schacht represents its nationalist and explicitly capitalist wing. As one of our party’s most prominent economists, he advocates strict fiscal conservatism, opposing Naumannite social liberalism. But in times of crisis, he may prove more pragmatic than he seems…

[? if schacht_plan_stage > 0 and schacht_plan_stage < 3 : Plan development: [+ schacht_plan_stage +]/3. ?]
[? if schacht_plan_stage == 3 : Schacht's new plan is ready for adoption. ?]
[? if schacht_plan_stage == 4 : The party has adopted Schacht's new plan. ?]

